==Battleground==
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 12~16 seconds<sup>360f~480f</sup>.
**5 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

